ies. Thanks to your Quartz powers, you are freer than ever. Be creative: Never has it felt so good to be greedy.","steam_appid":3290690,"support_info":{"email":"support@nacon.fr","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}